{"unit_id":"FIZMIE__dsh-restart-button#card-zh","repo":"FIZMIE/dsh-restart-button","commit":"5e21131dc6cba14f747c9d2f26c53c45424ae782","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-restart-button 是为 DeepSeek Harness 桌面应用提供重启能力的 DSH 插件，在 Web 客户端侧栏品牌名称旁加入刷新按钮，并在主机 Web 服务上注册状态、健康检查和重启路由。点击按钮并确认后，主机交由独立辅助进程重启应用，页面等待新进程启动后自动刷新；agent 或脚本也可通过本机重启路由请求操作。插件同时提供进程与可用性信息，并在重启后尝试将应用窗口带到前台。适合需要在插件或配置更新后快速重启桌面应用的 Windows 用户。使用前需在 profile patch 中停用官方品牌栏插件，否则按钮不会显示；重启会中断正在运行的任务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:75-94","client/client.js:167-179","lib/index.js:640-745","install/profile-patch.yml:36-38"]}
{"unit_id":"FIZMIE__dsh-restart-button#card-en","repo":"FIZMIE/dsh-restart-button","commit":"5e21131dc6cba14f747c9d2f26c53c45424ae782","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-restart-button adds a sidebar button and local route to restart DeepSeek Harness. After confirmation, a helper restarts the Windows app and the page reloads when it returns. Agents or scripts can use the route. A profile patch must disable the official brand row for the button to appear.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:75-94","client/client.js:167-179","lib/index.js:640-745","install/profile-patch.yml:36-38"]}
